# ART's ImageSpace::Load takes an exclusive flock on the boot image
# (art/runtime/gc/space/image_space.cc) so dexoptanalyzer can tell whether
# boot.art is currently mapped. AOSP Q's private/dexoptanalyzer.te never
# granted lock on system_file; later AOSP added exactly this rule with the
# comment "Acquire advisory lock on /system/framework/arm/*".
#
# Under enforcing the flock fails with EACCES, ScopedFlock returns null, and
# the analyzer cannot tell the image is in use. Both operands are core types
# and the gap is not a board fact, so this belongs in plat_private -- the
# same placement as system_app x proc_pagetypeinfo.
allow dexoptanalyzer system_file:file lock;
